; DO NOT EDIT.  What your tests in test/test_student.ml see as Gameengine
; On Autolab, your test_student.ml runs against OUR engine, which has only the
; declarations of the provided state.mli and command.mli, not the ones you add.
; This library gives your tests the same view here, so a test that uses
; one of your own declarations fails in "make test" instead of on Autolab.
; Tests of your own declarations belong in test/test_helpers.ml.

(library
 (name gameengine)
 (libraries engine))
